{"thread":{"threadID":3611,"boardID":117,"topic":"+++ Rust Server Online +++","time":1464895126,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","lastPostTime":1464960512,"lastPoster":"MaDNeZ","replies":5,"views":592,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":47697,"threadID":3611,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"+++ Rust Server Online +++","time":1464895126,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1904,"username":"MaDNeZ","time":1464960498,"value":1},{"userID":2086,"username":"sPredz","time":1464961893,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Heya Dream Community,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>heute Mittag ist ein neues Projekt in Form eines Rustservers online gegangen.<br>Wir hatten bereits vor einiger Zeit einen Server in Rust laufen, schalteten diesen aber damals aufgrund Geldmangels ab.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Da Rust nun aber auch Dedicated Linux Server unterstützt, ist es uns möglich den Server über unseren Root laufen zu lassen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Zu den wichtigen Informationen:</strong></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Server-IP: 46.105.160.158:28015</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Servertyp: Vanilla</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Slotanzahl: 100</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sleep aktiviert</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Reguläre Dropzeiten</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir freuen uns auf euren Besuch!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>BlackFire</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47698,"threadID":3611,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1464895531,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich besuch dann mal den Server <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47702,"threadID":3611,"userID":2068,"username":"Fiddles","subje